OL,3,GNEWSAHMO plans blocked amid
OL,4,A'overconcentration' fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a six-bedroom shared house
OL,7,Fhave been blocked due to concern over
OL,8,Fthe "overconcentration" of
OL,9,Fmultiple-occupation properties in the
OL,10,Farea.
OL,12,FSunderland City Council's planning
OL,13,Fcommittee said if the proposal to
OL,14,Fconvert floors above the MH Market in
OL,15,FRoker Avenue went ahead there would be
OL,16,Feight houses of multiple occupation
OL,17,F(HMOs) within 100m of the site.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
