OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHMO plans blocked amid
OL,4,A'overconcentration' fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FApplicants Halo's Luxury Homes &
OL,7,FArchitecture Vision Ltd had argued the
OL,8,Fscheme would "meet the needs of people
OL,9,Fwho require flexible housing close to
OL,10,Femployment and education".
OL,12,FBut there were 13 public objections
OL,13,Fabout the number of local HMOs, lack of
OL,14,Fparking, noise and privacy impacts and
OL,15,Fantisocial behaviour, and planners
OL,16,Fturned it down.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
